{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And you shall warn them concerning the statutes and the teaching.</b> He agreed with him also in what he said, ״והודעתי את חקי האלהים ואת תורותיו״ — 'and I make known the statutes of Elohim and His teachings'; but regarding judgment, which you said, ״ושפטתי בין איש ובין רעהו״ — 'and I judge between a man and his fellow' — appoint judges with yourself, for the matter of judgment is heavier upon you than all the rest, and it is better for you and for them to lighten the burden from upon you. Therefore he gave him counsel to choose from all the people men of valor."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:00:46.781547966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}